      "writtenOn": "2026-01-19T23:18:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t fit my mental model of how this works, but maybe that\u0027s an issue on my end.\n\nWhen we start to support swizzle-assign, this feels like it\u0027d cause problems because we\u0027ve prematurely stripped away the memory view. e.g.\n```\nv.yx.x \u003d 42;\n```\nThe type of the LHS should still be a reference, but I think with this special case that would not be true.",
