      "writtenOn": "2026-01-20T16:02:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This line is registering a Load of the object being swizzled, not the result of the swizzle. In the case of the fake Load of the result to fix the types, we actually don\u0027t register that Load. That\u0027s a very confusing sentence but am I on track there or thinking about it wrong?",
      "parentUuid": "908299b7_48bc8c6b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3605,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3607,
